@baseUrl = http://localhost:8003

### First call: resolve seeds (depth 0), returns a cursor for the next level
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/graph
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seeds": [
    { "provider": "openalex", "paper_id": "10.48550/arXiv.1706.03762" }
  ],
  "direction": "both",
  "max_depth": 2,
  "max_nodes_per_level": 25,
  "credentials": {
    "openalex": { "mailto": "team@example.org" }
  }
}

### Subsequent call: paste the `cursor` value from the previous response
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/graph
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cursor": "PASTE_CURSOR_HERE",
  "credentials": {
    "openalex": { "mailto": "team@example.org" }
  }
}
